                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 2553/3.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Minister Lee.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-05-01"><hi rendition="#italic">May 1,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Congratulate President Estrada in name of President and Government on his
                    escape.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Root.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
